Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.56,0:01:59.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] That was {\i1}way{\i0} off the mark!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.72,0:02:00.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.39,0:02:02.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's so loud down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.35,0:02:06.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cannon firing practice!\NBut it's not going very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.36,0:02:10.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Like I said... Let the\Nexpert aim the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.03,0:02:13.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Judging from the flying distance\Nof the last one, this should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.74,0:02:15.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.37,0:02:19.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Awesome! You hit\Nthat thing on the first try!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.37,0:02:21.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Wow, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.50,0:02:23.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whatcha think? I'm pretty magnificent
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.54,0:02:25.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,when it comes to aiming!\NSo, are you impressed yet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.71,0:02:27.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! You better believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.46,0:02:29.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So it's all settled.\NYou'll be our sniper.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.67,0:02:31.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Wait, I don't get to be captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.55,0:02:33.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] No. {\i1}I'm{\i0} still the captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.22,0:02:34.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [ZORO chuckles]\N– [USOPP laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.68,0:02:37.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Whatever. I'll\Nhumor you for now, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.89,0:02:40.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the second you do something\Ncowardly, I'm taking your post!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.85,0:02:43.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can live with that. But, you\Nknow guys, I was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.94,0:02:46.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's one other position\Nthat we have to fill
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.40,0:02:48.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,before we can head out\Nfor the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.36,0:02:51.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're right. The kitchen\Nis really nice on this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.03,0:02:52.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just... pay me, and I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.82,0:02:54.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] I suppose it\Nis vital for long trips.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.95,0:02:57.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] No decent pirate ship\Nshould be without one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.91,0:02:59.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A musician.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.33,0:03:00.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Are you an idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.66,0:03:02.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] What do you think\Nwe're doing out here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.66,0:03:05.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Just when I thought you\Nwere gonna say something smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.21,0:03:06.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] But we're pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.37,0:03:10.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And Pirates sing a lot!\NDidn't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.25,0:03:12.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] Get out here ya damn pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.26,0:03:13.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Hm?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.09,0:03:14.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.76,0:03:17.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! What the hell? Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.55,0:03:20.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] Shut up!\NWho I am means nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.26,0:03:21.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ya stinkin' pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.72,0:03:24.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [JOHNNY grunts]\N– [LUFFY screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.27,0:03:26.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, how many are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.39,0:03:28.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh... One.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.56,0:03:31.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then just let him handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.11,0:03:34.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Over the years I've lost count\Nof all the pirate heads
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.11,0:03:36.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we've taken. And now you guys think...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.53,0:03:39.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you can kill my partner?! [grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.37,0:03:41.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Hm? That voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.03,0:03:42.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] What do you mean by 'partner'?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.70,0:03:44.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look I don't know what this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.62,0:03:47.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But just stop wrecking our ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.08,0:03:48.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.54,0:03:51.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.38,0:03:53.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] Lost by a hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.34,0:03:54.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.92,0:03:56.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.76,0:04:00.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Johnny. Tell me that isn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.60,0:04:05.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?! Who's sayin' my name like they\Nthink they know me or somethin'?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.85,0:04:07.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps] Big Bro Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.81,0:04:09.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Johnny! It {\i1}is{\i0} you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.31,0:04:11.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[JOHNNY] What are you doin' here, big bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.61,0:04:14.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, relax! Is everything\Nokay? Where's Yosaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.19,0:04:14.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.94,0:04:17.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[inaudible]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.86,0:04:20.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, look. Zoro knows that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.41,0:04:21.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.04,0:04:29.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[cries] He's been sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.92,0:04:34.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.88,0:04:36.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.09,0:04:39.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] Up until a few days ago,\Nhe was healthy and full of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.43,0:04:40.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.38,0:04:43.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He keeps fainting!\NAnd getting really pale!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.47,0:04:46.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what's causing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.77,0:04:52.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[JOHNNY] His teeth have been falling out, and\Nhis old wound opened up and started bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.27,0:04:55.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He just got worse and worse! I\Ndidn't know what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.86,0:04:57.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.11,0:05:00.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe we'd just rest on a\Nlittle island. But, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.70,0:05:11.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] A cannonball came\Nflying from this ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.96,0:05:18.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY, USOPP whimpering]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.76,0:05:23.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY, USOPP] We're very sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.72,0:05:27.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] Sorry isn't good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.85,0:05:28.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY, USOPP gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.72,0:05:30.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.02,0:05:31.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] Isn't that right...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.14,0:05:33.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,partner!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.19,0:05:40.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] Big Bro. Give it to\Nme straight. Is he gonna die?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.61,0:05:42.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.32,0:05:45.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] So dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.58,0:05:47.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:55.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Whatever you're doing, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.25,0:05:58.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're mocking his death!\NDammit! You'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.75,0:06:02.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Luffy! Usopp! We have\Nsome limes in storage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.26,0:06:04.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What're you doing?!\NBring them here! Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.97,0:06:05.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP, LUFFY gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.68,0:06:08.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP, LUFFY arguing]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.11,0:06:21.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's got scurvy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.03,0:06:22.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] Scurvy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.11,0:06:25.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[NAMI] Mm-hm. If we weren't too late,\Nhe'll be just fine in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.82,0:06:28.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY gasps]\NReally, Big Sis?! Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.28,0:06:30.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Big Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.91,0:06:34.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please. Don't call me that.\NIt sounds so dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.12,0:06:36.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Besides, I'm not a magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.08,0:06:38.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This used to be a hopeless\Ndisease that plagued sailors,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.59,0:06:40.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and we just know how\Nto deal with it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.42,0:06:41.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [LUFFY] Here,\N– [USOPP] There you go,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.67,0:06:43.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– drink up sick guy.\N– have some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.76,0:06:48.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[NAMI] This is caused by a simple deficiency\Nof plant-derived nutrients like Vitamin C.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.43,0:06:50.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Back in the old days, they couldn't\Ncarry fresh fruits and vegetables
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.64,0:06:53.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,because they couldn't store\Nthem. We know better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.89,0:06:56.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] If a little is good,\Na lot is gooder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.44,0:06:58.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] You're gonna be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.02,0:06:59.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] You're smart!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.77,0:07:01.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're like... a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.82,0:07:04.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, now. How 'bout that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.15,0:07:06.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– I was right. She isn't dumb.\N– [YOSAKU groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.99,0:07:11.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You guys, are morons. Every\Nsailor should know about scurvy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.75,0:07:13.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU coughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.45,0:07:16.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP, LUFFY] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.33,0:07:15.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[YOSAKU grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.41,0:07:16.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[NAMI gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.42,0:07:18.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY, YOSAKU] Hooray!\NHooray! Hooray! Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.88,0:07:19.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hooray! Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.75,0:07:20.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] cured me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.63,0:07:22.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] Now you're all better!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.55,0:07:25.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't heal {\i1}that{\i0} quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.43,0:07:30.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY, YOSAKU] Allow us\Nto introduce ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.89,0:07:33.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My name is Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.27,0:07:34.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I'm Yosaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.27,0:07:39.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Together, we're the baddest pirate\Nbounty hunting duo in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.86,0:07:42.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] Big Bro Zoro\Nthere used to be one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.53,0:07:44.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] Glad to make your acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.03,0:07:49.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Small world. I never thought\NI'd see you guys again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.95,0:07:52.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] Well, if you\Nthink you're surprised...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.28,0:07:57.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[YOSAKU] We never imagined that the pirate\Nhunter Zoro became a pirate himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.21,0:07:59.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.04,0:08:00.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] Big Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.54,0:08:02.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.42,0:08:04.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.21,0:08:06.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.26,0:08:08.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh... Hey... Partner?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.34,0:08:10.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.52,0:08:19.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Let this be a lesson to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.73,0:08:24.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ZORO] Yeah. This is the kind of trouble you\Nrun into when you choose a life on the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.07,0:08:27.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[USOPP] Which means, when we're at sea,\Nwe really gotta think about how we can get
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.53,0:08:30.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the right amount of nutrients\Nwith very little food.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.36,0:08:34.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}It's absolutely necessary that someone\Non this ship knows how to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.79,0:08:39.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] It's necessary?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.00,0:08:41.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right! The ship needs a cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.83,0:08:42.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI, USOPP] Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.59,0:08:45.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Let's go find us a cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.13,0:08:47.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm in! Good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.05,0:08:49.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll have yummy food,\Neven while we're out at sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.59,0:08:52.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right. You got it. Ha, ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.55,0:08:54.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A cook? I know just the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.60,0:08:57.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And the food is gonna blow your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.64,0:08:59.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] Consider yourselves warned.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.94,0:09:02.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This place is close to the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.40,0:09:04.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I've heard a lot of rumors lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.86,0:09:08.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that a certain hawk-eyed man\Nyou're looking for is there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.36,0:09:12.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Set a course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.41,0:09:14.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,North-Northeast!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.33,0:09:15.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.41,0:09:16.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.66,0:09:17.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.58,0:09:18.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.00,0:09:30.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] Our destination is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.85,0:09:37.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] ... the sea restaurant...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.68,0:09:40.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Baratie!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.44,0:09:43.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY, NAMI, USOPP] Ooooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.94,0:09:47.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, heh, what do you think?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.57,0:09:49.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Wow. It's a big fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.82,0:09:50.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] How lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.74,0:09:52.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] This is the coolest place ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.78,0:09:53.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY, USOPP cheer]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.61,0:09:56.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] Just like I told ya, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.08,0:09:59.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[horn blares, bell rings]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.91,0:10:02.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! What the...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.21,0:10:04.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A Marine ship?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.67,0:10:07.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All the way out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.13,0:10:13.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy. They're not gonna\Nstart firing at us, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.26,0:10:15.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But. How did that ship...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.97,0:10:22.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FULLBODY] I've never\Nseen that pirate flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.27,0:10:26.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, do you think he knows that you\Nand I aren't a couple of pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.31,0:10:27.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.36,0:10:32.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FULLBODY] I am Iron Fist Fullbody!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.11,0:10:34.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But, you can just call me "Sir"!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.53,0:10:38.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You there! Who's the\Ncaptain?! Identify yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.28,0:10:40.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My name is Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.54,0:10:43.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My name is Usopp. Got it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.12,0:10:46.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We only made our flag\Nthe day before yesterday!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.58,0:10:49.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right marine! And I drew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.34,0:10:53.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh. You did? Is that so...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.39,0:10:59.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! You two! Right there!\NI've seen you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.60,0:11:03.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're that bounty hunter duo that\Ngoes after the small fish, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.35,0:11:04.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, well, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.69,0:11:07.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FULLBODY] So, you've finally\Nbeen caught by pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.77,0:11:10.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh. Well... Actually we...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.44,0:11:13.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FULLBODY laughs]\NNow that's a laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.07,0:11:15.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, c'mon baby, let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.24,0:11:15.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.78,0:11:17.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] Hey! Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.57,0:11:21.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You think small time bounty\Nhunters would go after these guys?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.87,0:11:28.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now. Let's go to that restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.46,0:11:31.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FULLBODY] They're an eyesore. Sink 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.71,0:11:33.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BOTH] Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.30,0:11:39.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] He ignored us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.09,0:11:42.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Next time we see him, he'd better\Nhave a little more respect for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.43,0:11:44.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Hm. What are these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.85,0:11:50.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, those are all wanted\Npirates, Big Sis Nam... Uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.65,0:11:51.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY coughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.65,0:11:55.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In other words, if we defeat\Nthem, we get the reward money.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.61,0:11:59.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pretty lucrative business,\Nhuh, Big Sis...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.16,0:12:01.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.50,0:12:09.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys, look! They're\Npointing a cannon right at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.84,0:12:15.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.13,0:12:18.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Now Gum-Gum...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.09,0:12:21.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.18,0:12:22.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY] ... Slingshot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.33,0:12:52.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOK A] Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.88,0:12:54.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOK B] Are you all right,\NHead Chef Zeff?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.63,0:12:56.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOK C] Sir, are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.05,0:13:01.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOK D] Head Chef,\Nare you sure you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.68,0:13:03.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] No! Nothing is "okay"!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.72,0:13:05.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOKS whimper]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.06,0:13:09.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] Never mind, just get back\Nto the restaurant already!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.44,0:13:12.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... but, sir! Aren't you, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.31,0:13:14.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] You maggots!\NDo you want to see me angry?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.65,0:13:16.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOKS whimper]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.11,0:13:19.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] Feeding the customer\Nis a cook's job!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.28,0:13:24.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to do?\NPut me out of business?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.83,0:13:29.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOK C] This is the guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.50,0:13:33.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOK D] He's the one\Nresponsible for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.50,0:13:34.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.50,0:13:38.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Sir, I'm very sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.46,0:13:42.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.09,0:13:43.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams] Your leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.80,0:13:44.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.51,0:13:47.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh. I see. Good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.64,0:13:49.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.35,0:13:55.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... I'm all banged up...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.94,0:14:00.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The medical fees and repair charges\Nfor the ship are gonna cost you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.19,0:14:01.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.24,0:14:02.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.53,0:14:04.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] I won't ask you\Nto cut me any slack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.62,0:14:06.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.33,0:14:08.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.08,0:14:09.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm flat broke!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.04,0:14:10.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.83,0:14:13.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, you're pretty direct, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.71,0:14:18.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you don't have money,\Nyou've no choice but to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.05,0:14:19.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fine. I wanna make it right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.88,0:14:22.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then you'll work, unpaid,\Nfor a whole year.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.72,0:14:24.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] I'll let you\Noff the hook with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.97,0:14:27.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh! A year?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.43,0:14:30.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you just say a year?!\NA whole {\i1}year{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.23,0:14:42.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[USOPP sighs] What's taking Luffy so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.32,0:14:43.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.65,0:14:47.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[USOPP] They'll probably make\Nhim work without pay for like a whole month.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.62,0:14:50.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] He should've just said\Nit was the Marine's fault
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.04,0:14:52.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,instead of being so freakin' honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.47,0:15:12.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh wow. That guy sitting over\Nthere is Lieutenant Fullbody.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.77,0:15:14.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.44,0:15:16.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, look kids. A big shot from HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.40,0:15:19.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh wow... He's so elegant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.94,0:15:23.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're famous. Everybody\Nin here is looking at {\i1}you{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.57,0:15:26.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, you're wrong.\NThey're all admiring you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.66,0:15:32.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FULLBODY] Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.04,0:15:34.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So good!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.75,0:15:38.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This... flavor...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.04,0:15:40.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And yes... the aroma...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.21,0:15:43.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It is the unmistakable scent from\Nthe soil of Micquo of the North Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.92,0:15:47.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bitter with plenty of body,\Nand just a tad sour.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.30,0:15:50.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This wine... must be...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.14,0:15:53.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the famous Iturutz Burger Stein.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.77,0:15:57.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me waiter, am I right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.48,0:16:00.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh. Not even close, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.86,0:16:02.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FULLBODY gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.32,0:16:07.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eat up. This dish is best when hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.41,0:16:09.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FULLBODY] Uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.12,0:16:14.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And, sir. My name's Sanji,\NI'm the Sous Chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.50,0:16:17.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All the waiters ran\Noff as of yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.42,0:16:21.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WOMAN laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.63,0:16:25.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[patrons laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.46,0:16:26.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MAN A] You really shouldn't laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.97,0:16:29.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WOMAN A] I can't help it!\NHe looked so confident!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.35,0:16:33.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you know a lot?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.10,0:16:34.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FULLBODY gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.14,0:16:35.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,About wine?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.22,0:16:37.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, yes... I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.48,0:16:40.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But it seems my sense of\Ntaste isn't working today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.15,0:16:41.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WOMAN laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.86,0:16:44.15,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[FULLBODY] What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.15,0:16:46.99,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm certain I requested that the owner\Nserve that particular wine
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.99,0:16:48.82,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,when I made this reservation!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.28,0:16:55.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can only work... for one week!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.16,0:16:58.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Right. A week, get real!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.58,0:17:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fine then. Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.00,0:17:01.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! You wrecked my restaurant
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.58,0:17:04.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and seriously injured the Head\NChef. That's a serious offense!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.96,0:17:08.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't just settle that up with\None or two weeks of unpaid work!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.42,0:17:09.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.63,0:17:13.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] You win! Three weeks!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.01,0:17:17.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Talk to me... with respect!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.81,0:17:18.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [ZEFF yells]\N– [LUFFY gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.07,0:17:26.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.78,0:17:28.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] No deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.94,0:17:29.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.95,0:17:34.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I waited ten long years\Nto become a pirate. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.28,0:17:38.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna waste another\Nyear stuck in this restaurant!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.08,0:17:39.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] Mm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.37,0:17:40.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'Kay. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.62,0:17:43.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get you to let\Nme off the hook in a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.29,0:17:45.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's my decision!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.63,0:17:48.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you value your time so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.34,0:17:51.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what you can do\Nto settle your debt quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.47,0:17:52.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ya runt!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.84,0:17:54.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.60,0:17:58.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It'll cost you... a leg, my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.97,0:17:59.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.98,0:18:01.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's pricey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.73,0:18:04.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh. Good, I got your attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.91,0:18:17.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Waiter! Hey! Get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.03,0:18:18.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.16,0:18:26.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] I believe I've already\Ntold you, I'm not a waiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.21,0:18:30.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What an irresistible beauty you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.84,0:18:31.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.92,0:18:34.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Would you care to join me\Nelsewhere for a glass of wine?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.80,0:18:36.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.68,0:18:37.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.85,0:18:41.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is "bug soup" on the menu today,\Nor did you make it just for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.43,0:18:42.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bug soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.68,0:18:47.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right. What's this\Nbug doing there, waiter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.31,0:18:50.48,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[FULLBODY] This is gonna ruin\Ntheir restaurant's reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.48,0:18:53.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sir. Don't know, really.\NLooks like he's floating.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.90,0:18:54.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FULLBODY grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.91,0:18:57.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then again. It kinda\Nlooks like he's drowning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.03,0:18:59.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But it's hard to say for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.08,0:18:59.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WOMAN laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.91,0:19:02.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[patrons laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.70,0:19:05.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FULLBODY seething]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.63,0:19:14.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you mess with me! Waiter!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.27,0:19:27.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] You could've eaten it if\Nyou had just taken the bug out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.77,0:19:29.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It would've been wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.69,0:19:32.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It took three full days of hard cooking
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.23,0:19:36.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to prepare that soup for\Nyou, and you wasted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.11,0:19:40.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FULLBODY] Can't you see that you're\Nbiting off more than you can chew?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.04,0:19:45.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm the customer here!\NDo you understand me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.83,0:19:46.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm paying you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.96,0:19:48.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Fullbody!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.58,0:19:49.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.63,0:19:51.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WOMAN gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.00,0:19:53.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No... Fullbody... No...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.88,0:19:58.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can your money truly\Nsatisfy your hunger?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.22,0:19:59.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whadya mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.51,0:20:05.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(5107,0,3,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)}[SANJI] I'm asking...\NCan it satisfy your hunger?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.85,0:20:06.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(522,0,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)}[LUFFY] No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.73,0:20:09.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(434,0,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)\t(830,0,1,\c&HFFFFFF&)\t(1352,0,1,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)\t(1750,0,1,\c&HFFFFFF&)}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.81,0:20:12.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is getting old.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.27,0:20:15.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're never gonna make it if\Nyou don't just give in sometimes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.74,0:20:20.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[panting] It's still no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.45,0:20:22.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[growls] No respect!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.42,0:20:32.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[patrons whimpering]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.13,0:20:36.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WOMAN] Fullbody?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.17,0:20:37.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It... It's Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.63,0:20:40.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.30,0:20:41.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.26,0:20:42.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.48,0:20:52.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FULLBODY groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.36,0:20:56.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't ever waste food around me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.19,0:20:59.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FULLBODY choking]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.36,0:21:01.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At sea, if you ever provoke your cook,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.87,0:21:05.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you're signing your own\Ndeath warrant. Remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.96,0:21:16.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MAN A] Just hold it... almost there...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.88,0:21:19.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PATTY] Customer service equals love!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.17,0:21:21.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And love equals restaurant!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.59,0:21:22.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PATTY] The customer...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.97,0:21:25.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,... is the king! [screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.14,0:21:28.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pleasant greetings to the\Ncustomer is what it's all about,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.10,0:21:31.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the customer is always right,\Nand we stand by that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.10,0:21:33.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hello and welcome, you damn crooks...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.40,0:21:35.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But don't you ever come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.11,0:21:37.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Awfully sorry about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.03,0:21:40.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're all so pathetic, I laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.36,0:21:42.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.16,0:21:42.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PATTY] Done!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.78,0:21:43.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [PATTY] Ah! Yes, indeed!\N– [MAN A gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.99,0:21:47.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Today will be a great day for everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.16,0:21:49.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello there and\Nwelcome, you damn crook.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.33,0:21:54.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}That's our service motto around here,\Nno doubt about it, the customer is... Ah! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.88,0:21:57.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PATTY] Oh, no! Our customer!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.00,0:21:59.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Not again, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.26,0:22:01.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're\Ndoing to our customer?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.59,0:22:04.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can't you see he's\Na Marine Lieutenant?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.05,0:22:06.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're a terrible cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.56,0:22:09.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What makes you think that\Nyou can talk to me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.31,0:22:13.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PATTY grunts] A crappy cook\Nlike you is calling me bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.06,0:22:15.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Restaurants can't exist\Nwithout their customers!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.90,0:22:20.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}They're our lifeblood, so we don't want\Nto hurt them the way you seem to keep doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.11,0:22:22.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But he deserved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.15,0:22:27.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}He didn't treat the food or me with\Nrespect... and he insulted all the cooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.75,0:22:32.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [FULLBODY grunts]\N– [SANJI] So I simply
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.21,0:22:33.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,taught him a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.92,0:22:38.55,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[FULLBODY grunts]\NYou're gonna to regret this...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.55,0:22:40.01,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,All of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.01,0:22:43.01,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,No restaurant should treat\Nits customers like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.01,0:22:45.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll shut you down...\NDo you understand me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.89,0:22:48.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will shut you down!\NThis entire place!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.51,0:22:52.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This whole restaurant is\Nfinished! Do you hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.10,0:22:55.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then, maybe I should\Njust finish you off now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.52,0:22:57.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FULLBODY gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.73,0:22:59.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOK LI] Sous Chef Sanji, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.11,0:23:00.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [COOK LI yelling]\N– Arrogant assholes like you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.78,0:23:04.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}who think they're such big shots they can\Npush anybody around really piss me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.70,0:23:07.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't keep doing this in\Nthe restaurant every other day!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.20,0:23:08.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.33,0:23:11.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're not such a big\Nshot now, are ya? Are ya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.20,0:23:13.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FULLBODY growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.50,0:23:15.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF, LUFFY grunt]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.12,0:23:18.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[customers gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.54,0:23:20.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.09,0:23:22.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [CUSTOMER A] What happened?\N– [CUSTOMER B] Are they okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.92,0:23:23.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.88,0:23:25.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY gasps]\NI can breathe again!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.63,0:23:27.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Boss Zeff, what's happening here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.01,0:23:28.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You didn't hurt yourself, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.60,0:23:29.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.76,0:23:30.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My ceiling!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.93,0:23:33.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Another thing that's gonna have\Nto get fixed because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.60,0:23:35.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is all your fault, you brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.60,0:23:37.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How is it my fault?! You attacked me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.56,0:23:40.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Boss, can you stop messing\Naround and give us a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.65,0:23:42.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji's gone crazy again!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.65,0:23:43.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOKS, SANJI growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.69,0:23:46.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [ZEFF] Hey, Sanji!\N– [SANJI growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.07,0:23:49.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] Don't tell me you went\Non another rampage in here, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.62,0:23:50.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Put a cork in it, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.91,0:23:53.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ZEFF] Oh, now you're ordering me around!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.70,0:23:55.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just who do you think\Nyou're talking to?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.66,0:23:58.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you want to sink my restaurant\Nto the bottom of the sea?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.50,0:24:00.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.79,0:24:02.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [FULLBODY laughs]\N– [ZEFF] You, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.50,0:24:04.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get your ass out of my restaurant!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.26,0:24:07.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FULLBODY groans, grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.43,0:24:10.10,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[FULLBODY groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.10,0:24:12.81,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[FULLBODY] What kind\Nof restaurant is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.81,0:24:14.81,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,That boss is like a gangster.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.81,0:24:19.23,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,It's almost as if... if...\Nthis were a pirate ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.23,0:24:21.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How can you deny our motto\Nthat the customer is king?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.98,0:24:25.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}The only kingly customers are the ones\Nwho stomach the slop that you call food.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.61,0:24:26.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's it. If you two wanna fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.53,0:24:30.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you'll keep it in the\Nkitchen, you understand me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.03,0:24:33.33,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[FULLBODY grunts]\NAre all these idiots really cooks?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.33,0:24:35.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MARINE B] Lieu... Lieutenant!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.37,0:24:36.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Fullbody!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.87,0:24:37.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FULLBODY gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.96,0:24:41.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MARINE B panting]\NWe've... We've got trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.46,0:24:43.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow, this restaurant is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.63,0:24:44.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sir, he's escaped!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.96,0:24:47.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pirate Krieg's henchman\Nattacked us and vanished!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.59,0:24:48.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.59,0:24:51.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Well, sir, we've already lost seven of our men,\Nand the only thing we wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.59,0:24:53.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,out of him was a lead\Non finding Krieg...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.72,0:24:54.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.68,0:24:56.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When we picked him up three days ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.35,0:24:58.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,he was right on the verge\Nof starving to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.44,0:25:01.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And we haven't fed him anything.\NWhere'd he get the strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.27,0:25:02.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Krieg Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.40,0:25:03.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[customers murmuring]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.57,0:25:07.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[CUSTOMER D] They're the ones who're said\Nto be the fiercest pirates in the East Blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.15,0:25:08.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Lieutenant, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.19,0:25:10.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gunshot]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.16,0:25:12.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[customers gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.82,0:25:15.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[footsteps]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.04,0:25:16.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.04,0:25:17.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.04,0:25:18.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.33,0:25:23.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It would seem we have\Na new customer, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.67,0:25:28.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He'd do well to mind his manners and\Nnot start any trouble on my ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.38,0:25:29.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A pirate, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.39,0:25:33.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FULLBODY grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.02,0:25:46.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't care what it is...\NJust bring me something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.61,0:25:50.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on... This is a restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.78,0:25:53.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hello and welcome, you damn crook!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.03,0:25:54.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[customers gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.49,0:25:56.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm just gonna say this one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.49,0:25:59.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bring me something to\Neat and make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.04,0:26:00.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That cook is gonna get us killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.91,0:26:03.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course, right away,\Nbut might I be so bold
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.08,0:26:05.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to inquire how you're\Npaying for your meal?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.05,0:26:10.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Will a bullet be enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.38,0:26:12.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So you don't have any money then.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.09,0:26:14.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [FULLBODY] What?\N– [customers gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.22,0:26:16.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That dumb ass, Patty,\Nbroke another chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.47,0:26:18.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa... What power...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.85,0:26:23.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry, pirate, but our policy is\Nto only serve paying customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.14,0:26:24.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [customers whistle, cheer]\N– You tell him!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.15,0:26:25.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kick his ass, Patty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.77,0:26:28.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Show that pirate we\Ncooks don't screw around!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.19,0:26:29.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[stomach rumbles]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.28,0:26:33.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[PATTY] Aww, I can hear\Nyour stomach grumbling from here, pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.40,0:26:35.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was a fart, jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.49,0:26:36.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.28,0:26:38.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get me... something... to eat now...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.95,0:26:41.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're not getting you\Nanything, so beat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.29,0:26:49.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FULLBODY] I can't take anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.17,0:26:51.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All of these cooks are insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.51,0:26:53.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've gotta get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.17,0:26:55.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't want anything to do\Nwith this place ever again!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.59,0:27:00.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[cheering continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.14,0:27:02.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PATTY] And now, you damn crooks...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.48,0:27:06.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you need anything,\Njust ask, okay? [laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.44,0:27:11.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And please, never come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.99,0:27:12.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PATTY grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.61,0:27:16.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN groans]\NDammit,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.74,0:27:20.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,if I wasn't so weak from hunger,\NI'd be inside eating...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.39,0:27:42.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] It's amazing\Nhow beautiful and cruel
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.89,0:27:45.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,this ocean can be, how it's\Nalmost a death sentence
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.94,0:27:50.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to lose your food and water out here,\Nhow difficult it is to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.23,0:27:52.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know what it means to go hungry
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.40,0:27:55.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,because of the sea more than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.07,0:27:58.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can die for your pride if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.78,0:28:02.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But listen, if you and eat and survive,\Nwon't that give you the opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.08,0:28:05.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to fight for pride truly worth\Nhaving, now and in the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.41,0:28:06.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.42,0:28:10.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN gulps]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.64,0:28:21.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN sobbing]\NI'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.89,0:28:24.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry... Thank you so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.35,0:28:28.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought it was over, I truly\Nthought I was going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.86,0:28:34.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN sobbing]\NThis food...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.19,0:28:35.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,... it's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.53,0:28:38.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've never eaten food this good before.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.74,0:28:43.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN sniffling, snorting]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.70,0:28:45.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.20,0:28:46.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.54,0:28:49.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think I just found my cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.25,0:28:52.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're lucky he gave you some food!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.29,0:28:55.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You weren't lookin' so\Ngood there... [laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.26,0:28:56.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought you were a goner!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.84,0:29:00.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So listen, Mr. Cook, why don't you\Nleave this boat and join my crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.47,0:29:01.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.55,0:29:04.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I could use a cook like\Nyou on my pirate ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.68,0:29:05.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI, GHIN] Huh?
